From: Lukas Rieger <code@lukasrieger.com>
Subject: [PATCH] network: make static address setup idempotent

network_down retains the interface address. Switching between ADB+NCM
and SSH+NCM must not fail with EEXIST. Also avoid shifting a signed int
into the sign bit when calculating the netmask prefix length.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/src/usb_moded-network.c
+++ b/src/usb_moded-network.c
@@ -1222,14 +1222,14 @@
         int cidr = 0;
 
         for (int i = 31; i >= 0; i--) {
-            if (value & (1 << i)) {
+            if (value & (1u << i)) {
                 cidr++;
             } else {
                 break;
             }
         }
 
-        snprintf(command, sizeof command,"ip addr add %s/%d dev %s", address, cidr, interface);
+        snprintf(command, sizeof command,"ip addr replace %s/%d dev %s", address, cidr, interface);
         if( common_system(command) != 0 )
             goto EXIT;
 
